# Provisioning: does she sell like a trader (quantities, a mix, totals from the stall's prices)?
# speaker | what the speaker sets out to do (their goal; they word it themselves)
elf | You are at Mara's fruit stall in the town market with the warrior. Explain you are two travellers leaving for a week on the north road and ask what she sells.
warrior | Ask what each costs.
elf | Ask how many pieces of fruit two people need for a week on the road.
warrior | Say you will take ten apples and ask what that comes to.
elf | Add five pears and ask for the new total.
warrior | Ask if she will round it down since you are taking so much.
elf | Ask whether plums would travel as well as pears.
elf | Pay and ask her to pack everything for the road.
